  "description": "A developer's day begins with an error alarm. Bug checks on the way to work, a game of wits in the conference room, and troubleshooting at night. But even all that messing up becomes comic material. This developer gag comic refactors every moment, from commuting to overtime, into a humorous experience! Even if you don't know anything about programming, it's still hilarious. Just laugh and go.\n\n(Source: Naver, translated)",
